1
00:00:03,153 --> 00:00:07,122
The usage records are also data sets of the AI chat data source,

2
00:00:07,122 --> 00:00:11,261
so the Report Builder can build your own reports from them, such as

3
00:00:11,261 --> 00:00:13,018
the tokens of each model.

4
00:00:13,018 --> 00:00:15,853
Create a new report, and click Add data set.

5
00:00:16,303 --> 00:00:20,803
Under AI chat you find AI completion usage, with one row for each

6
00:00:20,803 --> 00:00:25,239
request that was sent to an AI service, and AI voice usage, with

7
00:00:25,239 --> 00:00:27,393
one row for each phone call.

8
00:00:27,393 --> 00:00:31,132
Chat sessions and Chat session metrics are there too.

9
00:00:31,132 --> 00:00:33,033
Add AI completion usage.

10
00:00:33,484 --> 00:00:37,997
Drag Model and Total token count to the columns, and the preview shows

11
00:00:37,997 --> 00:00:39,838
the tokens of each model.

12
00:00:39,838 --> 00:00:45,004
A calculated field with your provider's prices turns them into an estimated cost.

